Additional notice — financial modelling disclaimer

This repository implements quantitative models of Iranian banking products and
Asset-Liability Management (ALM) for research, education and internal product
design. Nothing in this repository constitutes regulatory approval, a legal
opinion on Islamic finance contracts, or investment advice. Regulatory limits
seeded in the knowledge base are illustrative calibrations and must be
re-validated against the current directives of the Central Bank of Iran and the
Money and Credit Council before any production use.
